      "message": "feat: add smoke antigravity workflow (#34729)\n\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: pelikhan <4175913+pelikhan@users.noreply.github.com>",
